WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.130
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B one, Book two.

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.060
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:14.868
Unit fourteen: Staying Healthy. Today you will talk about healthy goals with would like to.

4
00:00:15.168 --> 00:00:17.937
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.284
Part one: words. You will learn twelve new words.

6
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.151
Nutrition.

7
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.357
Nutrition means the food your body needs to be healthy.

8
00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.799
Good nutrition helps you study.

9
00:00:31.383 --> 00:00:33.862
Your turn. Say: Nutrition.

10
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:37.655
Nutrition.

11
00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:39.569
Balanced meal.

12
00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:43.454
Balanced meal means a meal with the right mix of foods.

13
00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.944
Rice, fish and vegetables make a balanced meal.

14
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.179
Your turn. Say: Balanced meal.

15
00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:54.348
Balanced meal.

16
00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:56.015
Cardio.

17
00:00:57.017 --> 00:01:00.247
Cardio means exercise that makes your heart beat fast.

18
00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.408
Running is great cardio.

19
00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:05.565
Your turn. Say: Cardio.

20
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.343
Cardio.

21
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:11.456
Strength training.

22
00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.494
Strength training means exercise that builds your muscles.

23
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.234
I do strength training twice a week.

24
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:21.932
Your turn. Say: Strength training.

25
00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:25.977
Strength training.

26
00:01:26.717 --> 00:01:27.741
Mental health.

27
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.690
Mental health means the health of your mind and feelings.

28
00:01:32.283 --> 00:01:34.469
Talking to friends helps my mental health.

29
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:37.515
Your turn. Say: Mental health.

30
00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:41.403
Mental health.

31
00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.256
Sleep cycle.

32
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.620
Sleep cycle means your body's pattern of sleeping and waking.

33
00:01:48.217 --> 00:01:50.356
Phones can disturb your sleep cycle.

34
00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.660
Your turn. Say: Sleep cycle.

35
00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.757
Sleep cycle.

36
00:01:58.517 --> 00:01:59.506
Hydration.

37
00:02:00.517 --> 00:02:02.667
Hydration means drinking enough water.

38
00:02:03.283 --> 00:02:05.643
Hydration is important in hot weather.

39
00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.891
Your turn. Say: Hydration.

40
00:02:11.733 --> 00:02:12.804
Hydration.

41
00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:14.412
Wellbeing.

42
00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:17.950
Wellbeing means feeling healthy and happy.

43
00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.700
Exercise improves my wellbeing.

44
00:02:21.317 --> 00:02:23.632
Your turn. Say: Wellbeing.

45
00:02:26.467 --> 00:02:27.317
Wellbeing.

46
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:29.201
Self-care.

47
00:02:30.217 --> 00:02:33.122
Self-care means things you do to look after yourself.

48
00:02:33.717 --> 00:02:35.856
A warm bath is good self-care.

49
00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.451
Your turn. Say: Self-care.

50
00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.044
Self-care.

51
00:02:44.783 --> 00:02:45.970
Stress relief.

52
00:02:46.983 --> 00:02:49.668
Stress relief means ways to feel less worried.

53
00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.086
Drawing is my stress relief.

54
00:02:52.683 --> 00:02:55.162
Your turn. Say: Stress relief.

55
00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.396
Stress relief.

56
00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.221
Energy level.

57
00:03:02.217 --> 00:03:05.528
Energy level means how much energy you have.

58
00:03:06.117 --> 00:03:08.197
Breakfast raises my energy level.

59
00:03:08.783 --> 00:03:12.051
Your turn. Say: Energy level.

60
00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.215
Energy level.

61
00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:17.719
Habit.

62
00:03:18.717 --> 00:03:21.018
Habit means something you do regularly.

63
00:03:21.617 --> 00:03:23.872
Walking every day is a good habit.

64
00:03:24.483 --> 00:03:27.078
Your turn. Say: Habit.

65
00:03:29.933 --> 00:03:30.656
Habit.

66
00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:35.001
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

67
00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.407
Visal, what healthy habit would you like to build?

68
00:03:39.517 --> 00:03:43.249
I would like to exercise more. Maybe some cardio.

69
00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:47.629
That's great for your energy level. Anything else?

70
00:03:48.717 --> 00:03:52.066
I'd like to drink more water. My hydration is poor.

71
00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.337
And your mental health?

72
00:03:55.450 --> 00:04:02.235
I would like to sleep earlier. A good sleep cycle helps my wellbeing.

73
00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.295
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.974
Grammar focus: would like to plus verb.

75
00:04:09.274 --> 00:04:10.507
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:13.181
I would like to build a healthy habit.

77
00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:15.816
I would like to exercise more.

78
00:04:16.717 --> 00:04:18.542
She'd like to eat more vegetables.

79
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.267
Use 'would like to' for wishes and goals. It is softer than 'want to'.

80
00:04:24.017 --> 00:04:27.621
Be careful! Don't say: I would like exercise more.

81
00:04:29.567 --> 00:04:31.868
Say: I would like to exercise more.

82
00:04:32.168 --> 00:04:34.435
Use 'to' after 'would like' before a verb.

83
00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:37.851
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

84
00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:39.923
My Health Plan.

85
00:04:40.223 --> 00:04:43.465
Good nutrition and regular cardio improve my energy level.

86
00:04:44.467 --> 00:04:47.256
I try to eat a balanced meal and drink enough water.

87
00:04:48.267 --> 00:04:52.890
I also focus on mental health and self-care as part of my daily habit.

88
00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.619
When I feel stressed, music is my stress relief.

89
00:04:57.633 --> 00:05:01.572
This year, I would like to sleep earlier and protect my sleep cycle.

90
00:05:02.667 --> 00:05:06.738
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:09.293
I would like blank more water.

92
00:05:09.593 --> 00:05:12.700
A, to drink. B, drink. C, drinking.

93
00:05:16.267 --> 00:05:18.231
The answer is A: to drink.

94
00:05:19.383 --> 00:05:21.127
Drinking enough water is blank.

95
00:05:21.427 --> 00:05:25.313
A, hydration. B, nutrition. C, cardio.

96
00:05:28.867 --> 00:05:30.808
The answer is A: hydration.

97
00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.437
Exercise that builds your muscles is blank.

98
00:05:34.737 --> 00:05:39.761
A, strength training. B, self-care. C, a sleep cycle.

99
00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.822
The answer is A: strength training.

100
00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:50.440
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

101
00:05:51.283 --> 00:05:53.411
What healthy habit would you like to build?

102
00:06:02.217 --> 00:06:03.856
Now listen to Visal.

103
00:06:04.156 --> 00:06:12.370
I would like to build a running habit. I'd like to run three times a week, because cardio gives me more energy and less stress.

104
00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.530
Excellent answer, Visal!

105
00:06:15.417 --> 00:06:19.567
Great work! Now you can use twelve new words and would like to plus verb.

106
00:06:19.867 --> 00:06:24.922
Today's value is healthy habits. Sleep well, eat well and move every day.

107
00:06:25.222 --> 00:06:28.002
See you in Unit fifteen. Goodbye!

108
00:06:28.302 --> 00:06:31.767
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

